<title>USA: Carson Inc names Robert Pierce CFO.</title>
<headline>Carson Inc names Robert Pierce CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carson Inc said it named Robert Pierce chief financial officer, replacing Bradford Creswell, who will join Northwest Capital Inc as president.</p>
<p>Pierce was previously CFO and treasurer of Maybelline Inc.</p>
<p>Carson makes and markets ethnic hair care products for persons of African descent, and owns the Cutex line of nail polish removers.</p>
